}

@description("CoPresent canvas timeline: the v1:copresent:canvasState row family, the kind / data / visibility / actor / importance fields, the tool path vs frontend direct-mutation path, the per-kind renderers. Lets a specialist author canvas cards correctly (right kind, right data shape, right visibility) without trial and error.")
