@description("CoPresent realtime voice + video pipeline: LiveKit room participation, the voice-agent Python process, the STT / LLM / TTS / avatar plugin chain, the audio + video override row family, the per-(space, agent) toggles. Used by agents extending the voice path (new providers, behavior tweaks, voice-mode UX changes). Phase 2 ships a dedicated voice-audio-pipeline knowledge domain; this skill bundles copresent-ui in the interim.")
